  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "We apply each option on the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\nOption 1) 2 and 8\n\n27 - 2 × 4 - __**3 ÷ 8**__ = 1\n\n27 - __**2**____** × 4**__ - 0.3 = 1\n\n__**27 - 8**____** - 0.3**__ = 1\n\n18.7 ≠ 1\n\nOption 2) 2 and 3\n\n27 - 8 × 4 - __**2 ÷ 3**__ = 1\n\n27 - __**8 × 4**__ - 0.6 = 1\n\n__**27 - 32**____** - 0.6**__ = 1\n\n-5.6 ≠ 1\n\nOption 3) 3 and 4\n\n27 - 8 × 3 - __**4 ÷ 2**__ = 1\n\n27 - __**8 × 3**__ - 2 = 1\n\n__**27 - 24 - 2**__ = 1\n\n1 = 1\n\nOption 4) 8 and 4\n\n27 - 4 × 8 - __**3 ÷ 2**__ = 1\n\n27 - __**4 × 8**__ - 1.5 = 1\n\n__**27 - 32 - 1.5**__ = 1\n\n-6.5 ≠ 1\n\n**Hence the correct answer is option 3.**",
